<ul class="cs-metrics">
  <li class="cs-metrics__item"><span class="cs-metrics__num">−50%</span> median booking time (≈4 min → ≈2 min)</li>
  <li class="cs-metrics__item"><span class="cs-metrics__num">−33%</span> scheduling support calls, first quarter</li>
  <li class="cs-metrics__item"><span class="cs-metrics__num">+23pt</span> flow completion (58% → 81%)</li>
</ul>

